  m_Name: Entry_Famished
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: famished
  displayName: The Famished
  classification: Harbor Street Diner, kitchen
  lore: "Signs: cold rot under the cold-storage smell. Lights that won't hold steady
    \u2014 it pulls power like it pulls everything else, more than it needs, like
    it forgot how to stop. Claw marks on the inside of the pantry door. Inside. Something
    that wants in claws at the outside. Something that already got what it wanted
    claws to get out \u2014 and didn't make it."
  symptoms:
  - cold rot smell
  - flickering electronics
  - claw marks on the inside of doors
  weaknessText: "Fix: A line of rock salt. Has to be from that kitchen specifically
    \u2014 whatever was in the shaker the night it died hungry. Store-bought doesn't
    hold. I don't know why. I've stopped asking why about half of what's in this
    book.\n<i>Don't ask the owner before you take the salt. Just don't.</i>"
  weaknessTool: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 34a648778194b124fa08058b5ba4b5e2, type: 2}
  handwritten: 0
  hiddenUntilItsCase: 0
